  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Capacity strengthening of Development Education Network</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This initiative is seeking to strengthen the Development Education Network-Liberia to a level of building the organisation&#x2019;s self-reliance and staff capacity that will enable them integrate and address key thematic and cross-cutting issues in programmes and core organisational capabilities. It also aims at developing CAFOD-DEN-L strategic partnership to ensure that programmes and donors needs are addressed.
The organisation&#x2019;s monitoring, evaluation and learning system framework will be established to improve accountability and feedback at all levels of operations that will result in informed programmes and project development for the organisation.  The organisational capacity will be addressed in the areas of policies development, systems establishment.</narrative>
  </description>
